## 0:00–1:00 · The business notices first

Open the deployment's Companion App, then its **Lending Analytics** route (local fallback: http://127.0.0.1:8000/analytics). Point to one disputed rejection and the associated lending impact, or start directly with the recorded rejection below. Do not spend the opening touring the whole dashboard.

> “The application gives polite, well-formed answers. But some customers who qualify for financing are being rejected. A customer complaint gives us a concrete decision to investigate.”

The Companion report is a **cached historical snapshot** of generated data. Its appeal percentage means disagreement among **reviewed decisions**, not all applications; review is sampled. Live submissions and Dispute do not rewrite that report.

