## Reset

Teardown is project-level. Create a fresh demo project and re-run the seed with the same configuration and date anchor; the seed is deterministic.
Do not re-seed an occupied project: OTLP appends instead of upserting. Regenerating this runbook with `synth script` reads saved state and does not reset prompt labels or update historical results.
